 chapter ends on that  massive cliffhanger which suggests that  the noct we know has a secret identity  so what exactly does this mean then  morgan the younger brother  died at some point and then knocked  decided to join the black bulls  in order to honor his brother did he  also change his  appearance to look like his brother in  order to pay tribute to him  i can definitely see something like that  happening  like maybe morgan died in action at some  point in the past and knocked felt  terrible because he thought that if he  had joined the magic knight and fought  by his brother's side like his brother  had wanted him to  he may have been able to save morgan's  life  so then out of guilt noct decides to  take his brother's place  in the magic knights and maybe he also  assumes the appearance of his brother  because he wants to be more like his  selfless brother and less like his own  selfish self  this would definitely explain why noct  keeps saying that he hates  yami nakht was not yami's old comrade  from the azure deer squad  morgan was so maybe nakt actually  resents yami for not  protecting his brother since the two of  them were comrades  this is the scenario that i am  personally leaning towards  but with that said there might be more  to this story  or something totally different could be  going on here  i can totally see noct joining the magic  knights because that's what his brother  wanted him to do  but then why completely copy his younger  brother's appearance as well  that part is a little sus as if he's  trying to trick people into thinking  that he is his younger brother  but anyway what do you guys think what  is really going on  with this knocked morgan twist let me  know  down in the comments by the way this  reveal  also explains one image from much  earlier on in the manga when we see a  silhouette of the black  bulls one of the silhouettes is a guy  with long white hair  and this guy was never identified so  back before we knew who the vice 